SUMMARY:Fjord
LOCATION:Triplex Cinema\, 70 Railroad St\, Great Barrington\, MA 01230
DESCRIPTION:Times: 1:15pm\, 4:30pm\, 7:45pm\nFollowing the deaths of Mihai'
 s parents\, Mihai and Lisbeth Gheorghiu leave their life behind in Romania
  and move with their children to a remote village in Norway\, hoping to re
 build their lives near Lisbeth's family. There\, they grow close to their 
 neighbors\, the Halbergs\, whose warmth gives them hope for a fresh start.
  But the fragile peace begins to unravel when the Gheorghiu family’s you
 ng daughter\, Elia\, arrives at school covered in bruises.\nhttps://www.th
 etriplex.org/movie/fjord\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/
 westernma/
URL:https://www.thetriplex.org/movie/fjord
END:VEVENT
